<title>USA: Rubin predicts balanced US budget agreement in 97.</title>
<headline>Rubin predicts balanced US budget agreement in 97.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin predicted on Friday that the United States will approve legislation this year that will balance the federal budget.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe we will put in place balanced budget legislation this year,&quot; he told the Senate Judiciary Committee.</p>
<p>He said President Clinton will propose a &quot;very strong and sound&quot; budget Feb 6 that will balance the government's books by the year 2002 in a &quot;very reasonable and sensible fashion.&quot;</p>
